      "writtenOn": "2026-10-15T23:34:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As a followup to my previous review I was operating under the understanding that this change achieves something that is not currently possible in Zuul configuration. However, it turns out that isn\u0027t the case as detailed inline. Is there a good reason to add this functionality given this is already possible without any changes?",
      "revId": "85f74a01590074022aa3ab7e3a1c675dc8bd0804",
