      "writtenOn": "2026-10-15T22:05:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this may be redundant with the event filter\u0027s matches() method. Essentially we\u0027re creating an event to be processed by the pipeline which applies event filters here. But we\u0027re only doing it if the branch matches. Then later in the pipeline we check if the branch in the event matches the pipeline. The pipeline must still filter as not all pipelines will match all events, but I don\u0027t think it is necessary here as we could let the pipeline do all of the filtering instead?\n\nThat said I don\u0027t think it hurts to limit the number of events the pipelines have to filter so I\u0027m not sure this needs to be changed.",
      "revId": "85f74a01590074022aa3ab7e3a1c675dc8bd0804",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
